{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","prNumber":32,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/32","prRepository":"Sairanyx/Newbies","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:05:43.257Z"}
{"parentUuid":"29b3f325-c178-4a1a-9348-ef581b83a9f7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorTF33qhLoupSKEt3Wy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**It's merged: main is at `29afbc7` and CI passes.** Main's files are identical to what I tested, and #31 went in with it, so the Copilot buttons work again. Your main checkout has been pulled up to date too.\n\n**Copies now work the way you described:**\n- **Own ID:** a copy is the same object with its own ID, such as `obj-0049-copy1`.\n- **Default name:** it starts as `P-005 copy 1`, and its panel says \"copy of P-005\".\n- **Name it:** names any object with no record link, and the name shows in labels, Plan, BIM mode, the IFC and Val.\n- **Records stay with the original:** Val tells you the history belongs to P-005, not the copy.\n- **One limit:** a name can't be an existing record's tag, such as `P-005`, because it would look like that device.\n\n**Testing on the final code:**\n- **Automated:** 261 tests pass with the Excel data, and lint is clean.\n- **Browser checks:** 66 of 66 route, 28 of 28 combine, delete, duplicate and back, and 13 of 13 naming, with no page errors.\n- **Val:** I ran the flow with the real Gemma model before the naming change, not on the final code.\n\n**Still untested:** `./start laptop` itself, a tablet or touch, a real phone's back button, the 5090, or a person using the new layout.\n\n**To try it (you and the team):**\n```bash\ngit pull\nmake laptop-model   # about 4.6 GB; needs Ollama, so run it while online\nmake bim\n./start laptop\n```\n\n**Known gaps for the demo:**\n- **Moving an object away often doesn't open a path:** show a route bending around a moved object instead.\n- **Load time didn't improve:** it was 9 s on main before this work and 14 to 19 s now, one run each. Let the viewer finish loading before you start presenting.\n- **Val and the viewer share the laptop:** Gemma uses the CPU hard while it writes, and I haven't measured how much that slows the viewer.\n- **API restarts:** without `make db`, a restart forgets moves. `make api` now restarts only on edits in `app/`, so don't edit code there during the demo.\n\nEveryone's branches are now on main, so teammates should start new work from it. Do you want me to look at the slow load next, or would you rather try the new UI first?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":673810,"output_tokens":767,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":769,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":673810,"cache_creation_input_tokens":769,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":769},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b136b73e-8b12-48fc-a087-9978a06d40b0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgorTEamEYEtxYGvrnyxn","requestRef":"e6bb07e6-2ceb-404f-b184-015dbdf67d89","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"33f2146b-6ee7-4313-b504-8db60cb20467","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:05:50.336Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/viewer-and-val","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
