{"parentUuid":"262e9ef6-ac6e-4073-9e44-0529a63b488a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bcf82525-84d7-4ef2-9e83-41c3e47b2780","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CzeHcMDcp6vdHahpLcwiBr","type":"tool_result","content":"577ef9c Merge branch 'main' into hannu_branch\n3c7d165 Merge branch 'main' into hannu_branch\n docs/ARCHITECTURE.md      | 124 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\n docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md    | 225 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n handoffs/eduard-rednic.md |  12 +--\n 3 files changed, 355 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in docs/USAGE.md\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in web/bim.js\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in web/main.js\nAutomatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.\n docs/USAGE.md       |   6 ++-\n handoffs/yasasha.md |  12 +++---\n web/bim.js          | 117 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--\n web/hover.js        |  49 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n web/main.js         |  54 +++++++++++++++++++++---\n web/pick.js         |  43 +++++++++++++++++++\n 6 files changed, 245 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)\n################ docs/USAGE.md\n@@ line 63\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n  panel, so **Ask Val**, **Route here** and **Move** still work, and moves show in BIM.\n=======\n  panel, so **Ask copilot**, **Route here** and **Move on floor** still work, and moves show in BIM.\n  Taps use each object's simple Box shape in every look, so tapping a gap in a scanned bucket\n  still picks the bucket. With a mouse, the shape under the pointer shows as a faint outline first.\n>>>>>>> origin/yasasha/bim-pick\n@@ line 86\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n1. Tap the object. The smallest box under your finger is selected.\n2. Press **Move**, or **Rotate** to turn it. Only movable objects have these buttons.\n=======\n1. Tap the object. The nearest object under your finger is selected, never one behind it. Pipes,\n   hoses and cables only count where their scanned surface is, since their boxes are mostly empty.\n   With a mouse, the object's simple shape shows as a faint outline before you click.\n2. Press **Move on floor**. Only movable objects have this button.\n>>>>>>> origin/yasasha/bim-pick\n################ web/bim.js\n@@ line 8\n<<<<<<< HEAD\nimport { SplatEdit, SplatEditSdf, SplatEditSdfType, SplatMesh } from \"@sparkjsdev/spark\";\n=======\nimport { SplatMesh } from \"@sparkjsdev/spark\";\nimport { createHoverShell } from \"./hover.js\";\nimport { THIN_LABELS, pickFront } from \"./pick.js\";\n>>>>>>> origin/yasasha/bim-pick\n@@ line 390\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n      const owner = ownerOf(item);\n      if (item.object) cutFromGroup(item, Boolean(item.object.gone));\n      if (item.object && !owner && item.splats) item.splats.visible = false;\n      if (owner) {\n        offset.set(...(item.origin ?? owner.asset.center));\n        spin.setFromAxisAngle(UP, owner.yaw || 0);\n        for (const mesh of [item.scan, item.box].filter(Boolean)) {\n          shift.copy(mesh.userData.home).sub(offset).applyQuaternion(spin);\n          mesh.position.copy(owner.center).add(shift);\n          mesh.quaternion.copy(mesh.userData.turn).premultiply(spin);\n        }\n=======\n      if (item.object && !item.object.gone) {\n        placeShapes(item);\n>>>>>>> origin/yasasha/bim-pick\n################ web/main.js\n@@ line 944\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n=======\n  updateHover();\n  if (following && !tracked) route.update(dt);\n  else if (!tracked) phone.update(dt);\n>>>>>>> origin/yasasha/bim-pick\n=== sasha's bim-pick diff of key areas\n--- d9cd53c\nPick the nearest object, never one behind it; pipes block only at their surface\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n--- bc150ca\nHover outline in the scan view too, sharing the BIM hover shell\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n--- 9405c73\nBIM mode: pick by simple shapes in every look, with a hover outline\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n# yasasha: yasasha/bim-pick\n**Goal:** Reliable selection with a hover preview, in BIM mode and in the scan; nothing behind the nearest object.\n**Done:** web/bim.js picks and hovers by each element's simple Box shape in every look (Real, Mesh, Box); faint shell and outline on hover, pointer cursor; web/main.js checks the mouse once a frame. Scan view hovers the object a click would pick, outlined with its BIM simple shape (web/hover.js, sha\n**Verified:** make check 252 passed. Chromium on real data: rays through three bucket centres miss the scan mesh but pick the bucket in all looks; a real mouse hover and click picked bucket obj-0148; hover clears on empty space and leaving the canvas. Scan hover: bucket outline matches the clicked o\n**Next:** Check hover speed on the GPU machine; tablet has no hover, taps use the same shapes.\n**Blockers:** none. BIM Real/Mesh/Box merged in #28.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9161f452-1362-4c54-846e-ce7c19508a4c","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:22:49.499Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"577ef9c Merge branch 'main' into hannu_branch\n3c7d165 Merge branch 'main' into hannu_branch\n docs/ARCHITECTURE.md      | 124 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\n docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md    | 225 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n handoffs/eduard-rednic.md |  12 +--\n 3 files changed, 355 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in docs/USAGE.md\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in web/bim.js\nCONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in web/main.js\nAutomatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.\n docs/USAGE.md       |   6 ++-\n handoffs/yasasha.md |  12 +++---\n web/bim.js          | 117 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--\n web/hover.js        |  49 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n web/main.js         |  54 +++++++++++++++++++++---\n web/pick.js         |  43 +++++++++++++++++++\n 6 files changed, 245 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)\n################ docs/USAGE.md\n@@ line 63\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n  panel, so **Ask 