- [ ] \"Take me to P-005\" draws the route\n- [ ] \"Take me there\" on an object with no record routes to that object, not P-005\n- [ ] An answer comes at once, and \"In plain words\" follows with a model running\n- [ ] \"hi\", \"thanks\" and \"which spare parts?\" don't repeat a device's diagnosis\n\"\"\"),\n(\"- [ ] Speaking to the copilot (not built yet)\", \"- [ ] Speaking to Val (not built yet)\"),\n(\"- [ ] Each action works: boxes, range, view, apart, BIM, reset, copilot\", \"- [ ] Each action works: boxes, range, view, apart, BIM, reset, Val, duplicate, delete, rename\"),\n(\"- [ ] Copilot answers and speaks on the tablet\", \"- [ ] Val answers and speaks on the tablet\"),\n(\"routes, moves, copilot and voice all work\", \"routes, moves, Val and voice all work\"),\n(\"- [ ] Reach `P-005`: the copilot explains it\", \"- [ ] Reach `P-005`: Val explains it\"),\n])\nt = open(\"docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md\").read()\nnew = \"\"\"## Duplicate, delete, name and go back\n- [ ] **Duplicate** puts a copy on a free spot, with its real look, in the scan and in BIM mode\n- [ ] The copy has its own ID and a name like `P-005 copy 1`, and the original keeps its link\n- [ ] **Name it** names an object with no record link, and a name like `P-005` is refused\n- [ ] **Delete** asks first, **Keep it** keeps it, and **Delete** removes it from scan, routes and BIM mode\n- [ ] **Undo changes** brings deleted objects back and removes copies\n- [ ] Combining two objects, the result stays on screen before it's moved\n- [ ] After moving a combined object, and after entering and leaving BIM mode, there's no ghost\n- [ ] BIM's Box look shows a combined object as one box, with no real splats\n- [ ] Esc goes back one step, and finally deselects\n- [ ] The phone's back button does the same, and doesn't leave the page while something's open\n- [ ] With a mouse, a faint outline shows what a click would pick\n\n\"\"\"\nmarker = \"## 12. Val\\n\"; assert marker in t\nopen(\"docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md\", \"w\").write(t.replace(marker, new + marker, 1))\npatch(\"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\", [(\"Start it with `./start browser` or `./start tablet`.\", \"Start it with `./start laptop`, `./start browser` or `./start tablet`.\"),('CP[\"Copilot<br/>app/copilot\"]','CP[\"Val, the copilot<br/>app/copilot\"]')])\nopen(\"handoffs/viktortrilar.md\").read()\nEOF\ngit add -A docs; git status --short | grep -v \"^[AMDR] \" | cut -c1-50; uv run --only-group dev ruff check . 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-40; (cd \"$R\" && PYTHONPATH=\"$W\" uv run --no-project --with numpy --with scipy --with pandas --with openpyxl --with pytest --with fastapi --with httpx --with pillow --with 'psycopg[binary]' --with ifcopenshell --with ezdxf pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider \"$W/tests\" --rootdir=\"$W\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100)","description":"Update the team checklist for the new UI and run all tests","timeout":200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_read_input_tokens":685415,"output_tokens":4291,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":604},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4291,"cache_read_input_tokens":685415,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":14868,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_018XBZgGgfJ8EsHb33fLLJ7V":{"command":"W=/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa; R=/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; cd \"$W\"; sed -n 60,72p docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md | cut -c1-90; sed -n 96,112p docs/T