{"parentUuid":"bd0a5817-0900-4e0a-9dae-055e14393e44","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgouGNc18xh8bEa4qvKiC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Everyone's work is on main now (`7e6b051`), so the team can pull it and test.** CI passed on the PR. I didn't finish the full browser checks on this exact code, because you asked me to speed up.\n\n**What went in:**\n- **Eduard:** architecture overview and test checklist.\n- **Sasha:** clicks pick the nearest object, never one behind it, and a mouse shows a faint outline of what a click would select.\n- **Me:** the checklist now matches the new buttons and covers delete, duplicate, naming, back and `./start laptop`. Hover redraws less, because moving the mouse had dropped a ThinkPad from 54 to 19 frames/s.\n\n`sasha_branch` and `hannu_branch` have no file changes, and `viktor/viewer-objects` is that old merge, so I left all three out.\n\n**For the team:**\n```bash\ngit pull\nmake laptop-model   # about 4.6 GB; needs Ollama, so run it while online\nmake bim\n./start laptop      # ./start browser on a PC with a graphics card\n```\nThen work through `docs/TEST_CHECKLIST.md`, adding anything that fails under **Bugs** at the end. New work should start from main.\n\n**How far the testing got:**\n- **Final code:** lint is clean and 230 tests pass. Another 34 were skipped because that copy has no Excel data.\n- **Before the last small hover edit:** 261 tests passed with the Excel data, along with 28 of 28 combine, delete, duplicate and back checks, and 13 of 13 naming checks.\n- **Route checks, one open question:** one run failed the undo check. The route after undo was the correct 4.307 m, but the \"before\" value it compared against was 4.69 m, so it looks like test timing, though that isn't confirmed. The rerun on the final code had no failures in the 60 of 66 checks it reached before I stopped it.\n- **Hover speed:** the fix hasn't been measured, so tell me if moving the mouse still feels slow.\n\nOnce you have the team's feedback, send me the failures from the checklist and I'll work through those first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2340,"cache_read_input_tokens":706195,"output_tokens":980,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":289},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2340,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":706195,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2340,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2340},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ae5c41d-e967-49bf-90eb-ad011d0008bc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgouGNDgzNS1THco1mhZZ","requestRef":"7735cf6c-9224-47a6-9f5d-f9cc51f59c99","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"bd2bbad6-8d60-4a1b-ab5c-1b76f551d151","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:42:46.899Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/merge-team","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
