ts/select_frames.py:5:\"\"\"Keep the sharpest frame from each even window of a video.\nscripts/select_frames.py:9:Writes JPEGs, which carry no video metadata or audio, and a manifest.csv \nscripts/select_frames.py:34:def read_frames(video: Path):\nscripts/select_frames.py:37:    capture = cv2.VideoCapture(str(video))\n--- cart: why no turn\nbox [0.69, 1.32, 0.97]\n--- load time (no backend, same scene files)\nold main, full 396 MB scene seconds to ready, fresh browser each time: [11.1, 10.4, 10.5]\nnow, light 93 MB cut seconds to ready, fresh browser each time: [7.6, 6.5, 6.4]\nnow, full 396 MB scene seconds to ready, fresh browser each time: [11.1, 9.9, 10.0]","is_error":false}]}}
