{"parentUuid":"5925f0f0-b27c-4f00-a1ed-91a42f55cb41","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"24072eb3-f722-40d0-aa26-321dae0a2f81","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1rNweBUvC8GeYNh3HqWhC","type":"tool_result","content":"29:from app.copilot.tools import (\n33:    get_status,\n36:    search_docs,\n37:    search_service_cases,\n1 file reformatted, 99 files left unchan\nE501 Line too long (101 > 100)\n   --> app/copilot/copilot.py:100:101\nE501 Line too long (104 > 100)\n   --> app/copilot/copilot.py:123:101\nE501 Line too long (101 > 100)\n   --> app/copilot/tools.py:272:101\n[-] 'hi'\n   Hi, I'm Val. Tap a device and ask me about it, or ask what needs attention.\n[-] 'hey val'\n   Hi, I'm Val. Tap a device and ask me about it, or ask what needs attention.\n[-] 'good morning'\n   Hi, I'm Val. Tap a device and ask me about it, or ask what needs attention.\n[-] 'how are you?'\n   All good, thanks. What can I look up for you?\n[-] 'who are you'\n   I'm Val, your field-service assistant for this room. Ask me what needs attention, what's wrong with a device, what to check next, when it was last serviced, or to take you to it. I answer only from the plant's \n[-] 'what can you do'\n   I'm Val, your field-service assistant for this room. Ask me what needs attention, what's wrong with a device, what to check next, when it was last serviced, or to take you to it. I answer only from the plant's \n[-] 'help'\n   I'm Val, your field-service assistant for this room. Ask me what needs attention, what's wrong with a device, what to check next, when it was last serviced, or to take you to it. I answer only from the plant's \n[-] 'thanks!'\n   You're welcome. Ask me if you need anything else.\n[-] 'ok thanks'\n   You're welcome. Ask me if you need anything else.\n[-] 'bye'\n   See you. Stay safe out there.\n[-] ''\n   What would you like to know? Tap a device, or ask me what needs attention.\n[-] '???'\n   What would you like to know? Tap a device, or ask me what needs attention.\n[-] 'banana'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'asdfghjkl'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] \"what's the weather?\"\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'tell me a joke'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'what is the capital of finland?'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'who won the game last night'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'what needs attention?'\n   4 devices are marked high urgency. Start with P-005: health 44/100, Efficiency loss / fouling-like signature. Recommended check: inspect hydraulic path. Also high urgency: P-002 (45/100), M-006 (45/100), CV-003\n[-] 'anything urgent?'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] \"what's wrong?\"\n   P-005 needs attention. Its health is 44 out of 100, and the records point to efficiency loss / fouling-like signature. I'd start with this check: inspect hydraulic path. Follow the site's safety rules before to\n[-] 'is everything ok?'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[-] 'which pump is worst?'\n   4 devices are