was a bearing inspection, and the result was recorded as no fault found.\n[obj-0049] 'what is this?'\n   This is P-005, a process pump in Utility Island. It's attention required right now, with health at 44 out of 100.\n[obj-0049] 'is the vibration getting worse?'\n   I don't have vibration readings for P-005. Here's what is measured: Pressure is 4.509 bar and falling over the last 20 readings, between 4.468 and 4.927. Flow is 64.557% and falling over the last 20 readings, b\n[obj-0049] \"what's the temperature?\"\n   I don't have temperature readings for P-005. Here's what is measured: Pressure is 4.509 bar and falling over the last 20 readings, between 4.468 and 4.927. Flow is 64.557% and falling over the last 20 readings,\n[obj-0049] \"what's the pressure?\"\n   Pressure is 4.509 bar and falling over the last 20 readings, between 4.468 and 4.927.\n[obj-0049] 'which measurements changed?'\n   Pressure is 4.509 bar and falling over the last 20 readings, between 4.468 and 4.927. Flow is 64.557% and falling over the last 20 readings, between 63.347 and 83.191.\n[obj-0049] 'show me the flow'\n   Flow is 64.557% and falling over the last 20 readings, between 63.347 and 83.191.\n[obj-0049] 'what parts do I need?'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[obj-0049] 'how much does it cost?'\n   I don't have records on costs, so I won't guess. I can see each device's condition, measurements, events, work orders and guidance documents.\n[obj-0049] 'who do I call?'\n   I'm not sure what you mean, and I can't find it in the plant's records. Try asking what needs attention, or tap a device and ask what's wrong with it.\n[obj-0049] 'what is the manual for this?'\n   P-005 needs attention. Its health is 44 out of 100, and the records point to efficiency loss / fouling-like signature. I'd start with this check: inspect hydraulic path. Follow the site's safety rules b